        "created_at": "2014-03-14T21:56:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I typed up a category list for new players to choose a hero from. &nbsp; I imagine the list being displayed on the overhead screen of the Freedom Tower central computer. &nbsp;I thought I'd share it here as a pdf to print out and throw into the game box.</p><p>The categories are arbitrary. In the PDF, I used stylized catergory names, but actual categories are essentially: Damage Dealers, Tanks, Equipment&nbsp;Users, Utility and Support, and Versatile/Random.</p><p>Usually, I just tell new players to pick the hero that \"looks the coolest!\", but sometimes a new player stumbles into a play style they really don't like. &nbsp;I'm hoping the list will give players more information something to mull over as we start to shuffle the villain deck and set up the game. &nbsp;I do love explaining all the hero abilities, but I love it so much it can really delay us getting started for quite a while!</p>\n<p><a class=\"attachment\" href=\"/uploads/short-url/yrpwHacpIMmNqBvUD5pLixwBAn6.pdf\">Hero Categories.pdf</a> (139 KB)</p>",
